= The DVP has broken it's neutrality!

With violence has engulfing 33% of the country, the industrialists worry over their assets as already the RFB have begun to enact factory takeovers. After numerous talks with the right, they have come to an agreement. In exchange for monetary support, the far right promise to provide protection against the RFB.

